(III) ONE VOTING MEMBER REPRESENTING A HAULER OF RECYCLABLE 
MATERIALS, WHETHER REPRESENTING THE PUBLIC OR PRIVATE SECTOR; 
(IV) ONE VOTING MEMBER REPRESENTING AN ENVIRONMENTAL OR 
COMMUNITY-BASED NONPROFIT ORGANIZATION; 
(V) ONE VOTING MEMBER REPRESENTING A PACKAGING MATERIAL 
SUPPLIER THAT IS NOT A PRODUCER, WITH THE MEMBER ROTATING TO A 
PACKAGING MATERIAL SUPPLIER OF A DIFFERENT TYPE OF PACKAGING 
