(VI) ONE VOTING MEMBER REPRESENTING A MANUFACTURER OF 
RECYCLED PAPER PRODUCTS THAT IS NOT A PRODUCER; 
(VII) ONE VOTING MEMBER REPRESENTING A TRADE ASSOCIATION, 
CHAMBER OF COMMERCE, OR OTHER BUSINESS ADVOCACY ORGANIZATION 
REPRESENTING BUSINESSES THAT ARE HEADQUARTERED IN THE STATE; 
(VIII) 
ONE VOTING MEMBER REPRESENTING A RETAILER'S 
ASSOCIATION OR A RETAILER THAT IS NOT A PRODUCER; 
(IX) ONE VOTING MEMBER REPRESENTING A COMPOST FACILITY; 
(X) ONE VOTING MEMBER WHO HAS EXPERIENCE IN ENVIRONMENTAL 
